            <ArticleTitle>Failure to follow patients with hydrocephalus shunts can lead to death.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>399-401</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Failure to follow patients with hydrocephalus can expose them to potentially fatal consequences. Two cases are used to illustrate this and the merits of follow-up of these patients are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
